insert into questions (question_id, stage_id, chapter_id, type, prompt, code, answer, explanation, hint, xp, "order", active) values ('Q000182', 'STG001', 'CH0035', 'TYPE_CODE', '[INTERMEDIATE] Fix the Program

The following program contains mistakes. Correct it so that it displays:
